        "TileImage": "$($repository 335ce4e7-36bb-45cd-aa24-18564d48ed4e).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47. I have just received a contract from a old client, &quot;Locksley&quot;, asking us to eliminate two authoritarian politicians. The client is still working on the details of the targets, however he believes that they are likely to meet at the IAGO auction in Paris. The client wants a clean hit without raising suspicion, and collateral casualties should be avoided at all costs. You will be provided with further information upon arrival. Good luck.",
